    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Corrugated Sheets</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Acting as a rigid shell, these sheets lock the bike in place and prevent lateral movement. They are critical for commuter bikes that are shipped in bulk, as the corrugated box keeps the bike from shifting during handling.</p>
