<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Amravati to Pune | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does bike transport from Amravati to Pune typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time for bike transport from Amravati to Pune is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions and weather along NH 19, NH 27, and NH 48. Our hydraulic‑ramp carriers operate on a fixed schedule, and real‑time GPS tracking ensures you can monitor progress throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to ship a bike from Amravati to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To move a bike between Amravati and Pune you need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed transport agreement, and a GST‑compliant invoice if the move is for corporate reimbursement. Our IBA‑approved billing format includes all necessary details for seamless claim processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 7‑layer packing removable by the customer after delivery?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, the seven‑layer protective system is designed for easy removal. Once the bike is delivered, our trained personnel gently unwrap each layer, allowing the owner to inspect the vehicle without risking damage. All packaging materials are recyclable, and we provide guidance on proper disposal.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee zero scratches during the Amravati‑Pune bike shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by the 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packing, hydraulic ramp loading, and dedicated two‑wheeler carriers equipped with high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Each bike is secured with wheel chocks and monitored by 24/7 CCTV in our fleet, ensuring any potential impact is prevented before it occurs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Amravati to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every vehicle in our fleet is fitted with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal and mobile app. You receive instant alerts at key milestones—pickup, departure, en‑route checkpoints, and delivery—so you always know exactly where your bike is.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for high‑value sports bikes on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100% of the declared value of your sports or superbike. The policy includes protection against theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities. In the unlikely event of a claim, our dedicated support team handles documentation and settlement within 7 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike models or sizes for transport from Amravati to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet can accommodate all standard commuter motorcycles, scooters, sports bikes, and superbikes up to 250 kg GVW. Extremely oversized or custom‑built bikes may require a special quote, but most models fit comfortably within our enclosed carriers and multi‑car trailers, ensuring safe and efficient transport.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
